{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月9日 17:13 星期一</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月9日 18:12 星期一</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>下午3時許，海洋公園「海洋摩天塔」懷疑機件故障，停留在塔頂，約40名遊客被困半空，當中有人不適。消防接報到場將一名不適遊客救回地面，其餘30多名遊客，由職員帶領返回地面。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>機電署長潘國英回應說，若有機動遊戲發生事故，園區須按法例要求向署方提交報告，機電署亦會派員到場調查，查找成因，並與園區訂立方案，以防同類事件再發生。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕海洋公園 海洋摩天塔 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.060020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:13:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:36:06.371683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:59.004044+00:00","content_hash":"28f242cf88c7f9281c4783c2d806afda13edf3fe2db302c2399d7d3049303acb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}